# The served curriculum bundle and the lesson layer are *build outputs that are
# committed on purpose*: Vercel deploys the repository, and an offline-first PWA
# whose files are the product should not have to fetch its own content at build
# time. They are regenerated wholesale (`make build-curriculum`,
# `make build-questions`, `scripts/*_lessons*.py`), so GitHub is told they are
# generated: their diffs collapse in review, and they stay out of language stats.
# See "Does the bundle belong in git?" in docs/curriculum-data.md (P2-6).
public/curriculum/** linguist-generated=true
data/lessons/**      linguist-generated=true
data/audit/**        linguist-generated=true
